WEBVTT

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.307
So, these are what everyone's
been talking about?

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:15.204
They're beautiful. I can't believe this is Japan.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.612
| know! Aren't they?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.117
These are all Hokkaido?

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:23.178
Yup! At first I thought it was
some Scandinavian country!

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.786
I'm in awe every time I see them.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.071
They're really amazing, but...

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.928
Yeah, just because you're
in awe doesn't mean...

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.731
Who would actually go all the way to Hokkaido?

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.800
People normally don't.

00:00:42.409 --> 00:00:44.377
College Entrance Exam
Konno Academy Prep School

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:48.379
Summer Session: Intensive College
Entrance Exam: Special Seminar

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:51.850
Maybe Kyoichi just wanted to go on a trip?

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:55.088
Is he going some place he's never been,
in order to sort out his feelings?

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.900
But look at it this way!
You meet people when you're on trips!

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.169
Maybe Kyoichi will meet a hot woman that will...

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:03.094
...make him forget about the barbarian!

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:04.762
Yeah, yeah...
Yeah, yeah...

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.930
Are you okay?

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.543
I'm sorry. How about you?

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.971
Nothing stays the same.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.170
Everything always ends.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:26.747
It's hard to accept, but that's reality.

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:31.883
One season ends... a hew one begins.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:52.742
Early-summer rain is green
Samidare wa midori iro

00:01:53.680 --> 00:02:00.245
It makes me sad, a lonely afternoon
Kanashiku saseta yo hitori no gogo wa

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:07.022
I love, and I'm sad
Koi wo shite sabishikute

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:11.440
My warm thoughts...
Todokanu omoi wo

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:16.026
...would never reach her
atatameteita

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:22.267
I couldn't tell her I love her, my first love
Suki da yo to iezuni hatsukoi wa

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:29.849
<i>Like a pendulum heart
Furiko zaiku no kokoro</i>

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.896
I saw you running on the school field...
Houkago no koutei wo

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:37.356
...one afternoon
hashiru kimi ga ita

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:45.194
From far away, I looked for you forever
Tooku de boku wa itsudemo kimi wo sagashiteita

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:53.304
It's a waning dream, so it won't leave my heart
Asai yume dakara mune wo hanarenai

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:17.222
The End of the Road

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.045
Are you sure?

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.561
Yeah, I was going back anyway.

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:28.017
Or... do you not want to ride with me??

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.533
No, that's not it. Thank you.

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.974
Dummy! Hang on!

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:40.983
I'm not picking you up if you fall off!

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:43.279
Okay! Sorry!

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.193
Thank you very much.

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:59.897
Sure thing. These are very popular.

00:04:00.006 --> 00:04:02.031
Really? Thanks!

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:05.676
It's a cute wood carving.

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:07.413
Did you make that?

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:09.610
| know it's strange.

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:13.681
A biker chick like me,
making small wood carvings...

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.811
Oh, I don't think it's strange.

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:19.681
You're a nice guy.

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:23.855
Now, hop on.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.820
We have to hurry or it's going to get dark.

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:34.430
By the way...

00:04:35.341 --> 00:04:37.241
You speak Japanese really well.

00:04:38.811 --> 00:04:40.074
| am Japanese.

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:45.080
My father's Finnish, but my
mother is a Tokyo native.

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:49.078
| may not look it, but I was
born and raised in Tokyo.

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:51.849
Tokyo? How long have
you been in Hokkaido?

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.591
I've been living here for a year.

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:55.838
| see.

00:04:55.862 --> 00:04:57.193
That's the story.

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:03.635
Thank you very much!

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:09.675
Well? How do you like Hokkaido?

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:12.306
The air is different.

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.580
It's not thick like Tokyo.

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:16.914
Even the colors of nature seem different.

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:19.084
What a calm assessment...

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:21.353
Could you describe it any more plainly?

00:05:22.055 --> 00:05:23.399
When I first came I was like,

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:27.053
"It's amazing! I need to touch everything!"

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.022
What?

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.328
W-What's wrong?

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:43.207
A squirrel.

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.342
It's a red squirrel.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:48.508
They're rare. Even the locals rarely see them.

00:05:48.715 --> 00:05:49.682
Really?

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:51.106
Well?

00:05:51.417 --> 00:05:53.476
It's huge. But it's cute.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.610
| like that answer.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:58.956
Let's get going to our destination.

00:06:00.426 --> 00:06:02.394
My tours aren't cheap you know.

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:09.199
Here, right?

00:06:10.636 --> 00:06:11.262
Yeah...

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:17.005
Well?

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:19.475
It's so vast...

00:06:20.079 --> 00:06:23.879
This picture is only a small section.

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:39.296
Why don't you try it? It feels great.

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:41.632
That's okay, I'm fine...

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:44.567
Why not? You came all this way.

00:06:46.005 --> 00:06:47.803
You're a shy guy.

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:52.072
I'll be playing over there,
so call me when you're done.

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:55.376
Your sketch. That's why you came here, right?

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:56.909
Yeah...

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:16.197
Hey!

00:07:18.171 --> 00:07:21.664
The view over here is great, too. Come here!

00:07:22.842 --> 00:07:24.003
I'm coming!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.507
Hey! That's dangerous!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.313
It's fine. It's fine.

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:41.350
Are you okay?

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:46.554
No, I'm not okay... I landed on my butt!

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:49.060
Owww!

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:52.264
Ouch...

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:56.172
Hey! Stop laughing!

00:07:57.944 --> 00:07:58.968
Oowww...

00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:24.903
Hey, do you want to Kiss?

00:08:26.138 --> 00:08:27.367
It's a joke.

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:32.905
That's what you get for laughing at me.

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:35.905
Jeez...

00:08:44.323 --> 00:08:45.290
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:08:45.391 --> 00:08:46.483
Here's your carbonara.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.190
It looks good. Thanks for the food!

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:56.167
What's wrong?

00:08:56.302 --> 00:08:57.531
| remembered something...

00:08:58.137 --> 00:09:02.951
He used to be good at making carbonara, too...

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:03.840
He?

00:09:03.976 --> 00:09:04.875
My boyfriend...

00:09:05.244 --> 00:09:07.338
If he were alive, he'd be...

00:09:08.648 --> 00:09:10.047
Oh, I see...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.540
Your boyfriend...

00:09:13.119 --> 00:09:16.316
I'm sorry. It's my fault for ordering carbonara...

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:24.896
Just kidding!

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:28.710
You are too gullible!

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:29.997
You're such a nice guy!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.160
It's not funny!

00:09:32.271 --> 00:09:33.932
Thanks for the food!

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:38.537
It's yummy! Carbonara tastes
great after you fool someone!

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:41.004
Oh, that's right!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:42.008
What?

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:45.183
Do you know where you're staying tonight?

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:51.652
Here?

00:09:52.458 --> 00:09:53.016
Yup.

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.299
Wow.

00:10:03.769 --> 00:10:05.066
It's my workshop.

00:10:05.538 --> 00:10:06.369
Pretty neat, right?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:09.138
I'm surprised at how nice it is inside.

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:10.409
How rude...

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:12.175
Make yourself comfortable.

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:13.472
I'll go make some coffee.

00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:16.843
You live here?

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:17.505
Yup.

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:18.927
By yourself?

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:20.043
Yeah, why?

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.788
Are you sure I can stay here?

00:10:23.155 --> 00:10:24.953
| wouldn't have brought you here if I wasn't sure.

00:10:25.758 --> 00:10:27.658
Don't worry, I won't pounce on you.

00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:45.042
Wow...

00:10:45.177 --> 00:10:47.168
There are so many stars.

00:10:47.346 --> 00:10:49.678
When I first looked up at the sky here...

00:10:49.915 --> 00:10:53.112
...was scared because I thought I was
going to get squished by a wall of stars.

00:10:56.756 --> 00:10:57.733
It's beautiful...

00:10:57.757 --> 00:10:59.748
Yeah, it's beautiful...

00:11:06.832 --> 00:11:07.993
Wanna Kiss?

00:11:09.735 --> 00:11:11.863
I'm not falling for it twice.

00:11:15.441 --> 00:11:16.602
You're a good guy.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:19.945
You really are a good guy!

00:11:26.786 --> 00:11:27.947
Warning Bear sightings Be alert

00:11:33.759 --> 00:11:36.438
When my boyfriend and |
were driving around here...

00:11:36.462 --> 00:11:39.159
...thick fog came down, and my boyfriend said...

00:11:39.365 --> 00:11:44.496
"Look at the thick fog! We're going to get lost!"

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:49.518
Then I was like "Don't FOGet!" and
he just held his head and said,

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:51.253
"What's with that old man joke?"

00:11:51.277 --> 00:11:53.143
"That's just a crime against humanity!"

00:11:53.345 --> 00:11:56.992
So we kept driving and we saw
the bear sighting sign and I said...

00:11:57.016 --> 00:11:57.859
Warning Bear sightings Be alert So we kept driving
and we saw the bear sighting sign and I said...

00:11:57.883 --> 00:11:58.349
So we kept driving and we saw
the bear sighting sign and I said...

00:11:59.518 --> 00:12:02.497
"What are we going to do if we
run into a bear?" and he said...

00:12:02.521 --> 00:12:04.700
"Hmm... That would be BEARy bad."

00:12:04.724 --> 00:12:06.001
Can you believe him?

00:12:06.025 --> 00:12:08.187
Then he held his head again and said,

00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:11.488
"“Now I'm committing a crime against humanity!"

00:12:12.665 --> 00:12:16.329
Is this the boyfriend that makes
good carbonara and passed away?

00:12:18.704 --> 00:12:21.833
He's in Provence now.

00:12:22.374 --> 00:12:23.432
Provence?

00:12:23.709 --> 00:12:24.699
Southern France.

00:12:25.444 --> 00:12:27.435
Apparently the scenery is similar to around here.

00:12:27.847 --> 00:12:28.746
| see.

00:12:29.115 --> 00:12:32.085
It was his dream to draw in Provence.

00:12:32.518 --> 00:12:34.486
So, his dream came true.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:35.816
| guess.

00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:39.816
He was such a gullible sissy.
| could never count on him.

00:12:40.559 --> 00:12:42.049
But I loved him...

00:12:44.363 --> 00:12:45.956
That's why I broke up with him.

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.198
| was only a burden to him...

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:54.900
My being with him took away his freedom.

00:12:55.307 --> 00:12:56.297
That's not...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.075
Did you buy that?

00:13:00.012 --> 00:13:00.843
Say what?

00:13:02.081 --> 00:13:02.691
Jeez!

00:13:02.715 --> 00:13:02.924
| can't believe you!
Jeez!

00:13:02.948 --> 00:13:04.040
| can't believe you!

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.648
I've never met someone so gullible!

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.182
| feel great today!

00:13:12.992 --> 00:13:13.550
Let's swim!

00:13:16.228 --> 00:13:20.529
B-B-But! I don't have my bathing
suit... and it's still chilly out...

00:13:29.842 --> 00:13:32.777
If you're not going to swim,
can you go over there?

00:13:33.312 --> 00:13:34.609
I'm sorry!

00:13:50.896 --> 00:13:51.920
It's a red fox!

00:13:53.866 --> 00:13:54.697
Come here!

00:13:59.104 --> 00:14:00.299
