00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:03.907
That's great...

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:04.870
Yeah...

00:14:06.745 --> 00:14:10.992
By the way, we haven't introduced ourselves yet.

00:14:11.016 --> 00:14:13.451
Oh, you're right.

00:14:13.719 --> 00:14:16.188
I'm Kyoichi. Kyoichi Kanzaki.

00:14:16.589 --> 00:14:17.522
Kyoichi.

00:14:18.057 --> 00:14:18.853
What's your name?

00:14:19.425 --> 00:14:20.449
I'm...

00:14:20.993 --> 00:14:21.721
...Chiharu.

00:14:27.566 --> 00:14:32.113
This song, "First Love," was originally
written by Kouzou Murashita, correct?

00:14:32.137 --> 00:14:35.107
Yes. It's a song that was written twenty years ago.

00:14:35.341 --> 00:14:39.955
I'm not familiar with it because it was
before I was born, but when I heard it...

00:14:39.979 --> 00:14:41.189
...I was completely in awe.

00:14:41.213 --> 00:14:42.647
The lyrics are really amazing.

00:14:43.415 --> 00:14:44.192
It's about a boy who fell in love
with a girl on the track team.

00:14:44.216 --> 00:14:45.093
<i>It's about a boy who fell in love
with a girl on the track team. Thanks.</i>

00:14:45.117 --> 00:14:46.261
It's about a boy who fell in love with a
gir! on the track team. Are you getting far?

00:14:46.285 --> 00:14:47.116
<i>It's about a boy who fell in love
with a girl on the track team. So-so.</i>

00:14:47.253 --> 00:14:47.462
Can I see it?

00:14:47.486 --> 00:14:47.896
He watches her run from afar, but
doesn't have the courage... Can I see it?

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:48.563
He watches her run from afar,
but doesn't have the courage...

00:14:48.587 --> 00:14:49.097
He watches her run from afar, but doesn't
have the courage... What do you think?

00:14:49.121 --> 00:14:50.098
He watches her run from afar,
but doesn't have the courage...

00:14:50.122 --> 00:14:51.733
...to tell her he loves her.

00:14:51.757 --> 00:14:52.567
Yes. Yes.

00:14:52.591 --> 00:14:53.034
Hey... Can I be honest?

00:14:53.058 --> 00:14:54.736
Let's play that song now.
Hey... Can I be honest?

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:54.836
Hey... Can I be honest?

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:55.270
Okay!

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:55.570
Sure.

00:14:55.594 --> 00:14:55.904
Here you go. Please listen
