00:14:55.928 --> 00:14:56.638
Here you go. Please listen to it.
“First Love."

00:14:56.662 --> 00:14:58.340
Here you go. Please listen to it.
“First Love." | thought this earlier too...

00:14:58.364 --> 00:14:58.840
Here you go. Please listen to it.
“First Love."

00:14:58.864 --> 00:15:00.855
How do I say this... It's very stuffy.

00:15:02.601 --> 00:15:05.213
It feels like you're trying too hard...

00:15:05.237 --> 00:15:07.365
...to squeeze everything onto this paper.

00:15:08.107 --> 00:15:09.718
To be more straight forward,

00:15:09.742 --> 00:15:11.176
it doesn't have any warmth to it.

00:15:13.178 --> 00:15:16.341
Kyoichi, you were in awe earlier today...

00:15:16.649 --> 00:15:19.209
...but I don't see that at all on here.

00:15:33.799 --> 00:15:35.927
Kyoichi, is there someone you like right now?

00:15:36.235 --> 00:15:37.361
No, but...

00:15:38.003 --> 00:15:39.095
|/ see.

00:15:40.005 --> 00:15:43.051
You draw because you like to draw, right?

00:15:43.075 --> 00:15:43.564
Yeah.

00:15:44.209 --> 00:15:47.440
You have to take a good look at the
cherry blossoms before they fall.

00:15:47.846 --> 00:15:50.440
I just realized this recently, but...

00:15:51.684 --> 00:15:54.244
You don't need a reason to be into something.

00:15:54.787 --> 00:15:55.864
