00:17:25.277 --> 00:17:26.210
Kyoichi...

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:32.048
You really are sweet. You act just like him...

00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:34.850
| always told him how much I loved him.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:38.087
