00:17:38.323 --> 00:17:40.417
He never told me he loved me.

00:17:41.226 --> 00:17:45.060
It started to become painful, so I said goodbye...

00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:48.432
| wonder why he never told me?

00:17:49.234 --> 00:17:50.565
Do you think he was embarrassed?

00:17:51.136 --> 00:17:53.662
Or was it because it was easier?

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.607
| don't Know.

00:18:53.332 --> 00:18:54.322
Morning...

00:18:55.634 --> 00:18:56.533
I got it.

00:18:57.603 --> 00:18:59.867
He was hiding away in his own little world.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.730
He didn't want to get hurt.

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:07.074
He was scared to lose... his sense of self...

00:19:09.548 --> 00:19:12.017
I'm glad I came here.

00:19:22.161 --> 00:19:24.755
I'm sure you'll be able to draw
an amazing sketch next time.

00:19:25.297 --> 00:19:27.197
Because I'll draw how I feel.

00:19:27.799 --> 00:19:30.325
But it might end up not having any focus.

00:19:30.602 --> 00:19:34.004
| don't think that's bad. That's who you are now.

00:19:36.208 --> 00:19:37.937
Thanks for everything.

00:19:38.577 --> 00:19:42.309
No, thank you. I finally found the answer.

00:19:42.581 --> 00:19:43.548
Take care of yourself.

00:19:43.682 --> 00:19:44.308
I will.

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:47.977
Oh, right. I didn't pay you yet.

00:19:48.387 --> 00:19:49.980
Your expensive tour guide fee.

00:19:50.622 --> 00:19:52.147
Oh, that.

00:19:54.159 --> 00:19:54.955
Then...

00:19:56.762 --> 00:19:59.925
Give me a Kiss... like you mean it.

00:20:14.813 --> 00:20:17.373
See you. Take care of yourself, Kyoichi!

00:20:17.683 --> 00:20:18.844
You too, Chiharu.

00:20:19.017 --> 00:20:19.643
Adieu!

00:20:30.796 --> 00:20:34.357
Once it passes, it will feel like it went by in a flash.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.929
Things that will one day turn into a funny story.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.382
But, that feeling will never disappear...

00:20:41.406 --> 00:20:43.272
...and will always be deep in your heart.

00:20:43.342 --> 00:20:47.609
An important season that we can
only see now... Our season...

00:20:53.585 --> 00:20:58.682
One season ends... a new one begins...

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:08.396
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikonderu mitai

00:21:10.002 --> 00:21:16.704
Voice, my voice. I want it to reach you
Voice, my voice. Todoketai yo kimi ni

00:21:17.309 --> 00:21:25.273
Things aren't going the way you'd like
Omoi douri ni naranai koto nara

00:21:25.651 --> 00:21:33.651
That might happen a lot now, but...
Ima wa takusan attarisuru kedo

00:21:36.061 --> 00:21:40.623
Tomorrow, another new wind
Mata ashita wa chigau kaze

00:21:40.999 --> 00:21:44.094
will blow your way
fuite kuru yo

00:21:44.403 --> 00:21:49.102
Spread your arms and let your chest
Ryoute wo hirogeta mune ni

00:21:49.341 --> 00:21:52.504
just feel the breeze
kanjiru mama

00:21:52.744 --> 00:21:57.477
No matter what befalls us,
Nani ga osoi kakattemo

00:21:57.582 --> 00:22:00.745
no matter how difficult it may be
semetatete mo

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:08.192
We'll be all right
Watashi tachi wa daijoubu

00:22:45.797 --> 00:22:46.787
I'm home.

00:22:48.667 --> 00:22:49.759
Welcome back.
